5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Hello everyone. To ensure we make a sustainable choice, I would like to look into this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll be looking into the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the visit completion on the shared nursing round. It's important to see if previous efforts actually yielded results.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I think it's important to understand how our staff are doing. I'll look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want to make sure we have the space for whatever we pick! I'll check the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and also what the booking system records.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is so lovely to see everyone working together. I shall look into the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries to see how our partnerships have fared.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
